PDFium (page rendering for the visual comparison of revisions)

The release packages ship pdfium.dll next to the executables; it is loaded at run
time, never linked. Build: https://github.com/bblanchon/pdfium-binaries release
chromium/7881 (PDFium 151.0.7881.0), pinned with its SHA-256 in
third_party/pdfium/PDFIUM_VERSION.txt. The packaging scripts copy the binary
build's licence (MIT, Copyright 2014-2025 Benoit Blanchon) and the licences of
the components PDFium bundles (FreeType, libjpeg-turbo, OpenJPEG, Little CMS,
libpng, zlib, libtiff, ICU, Abseil, AGG, fast_float, simdutf, LLVM libc) into
licenses/pdfium/ of every package.

